# UTM font files are never committed — unauthorized derivatives of commercial
# typefaces. See docs/utm-font-system.md. The Sài Gòn 1985 pack is committed
# on purpose: it is free for any use, and the app needs it to letter that era.
fonts/*
!fonts/README.md
!fonts/manifest.json
!fonts/saigon1985/

